{"_data": [{"contents": [{"content": "Peter and Online Dating", "type": "lesson_name"}, {"content": "Meet Your Mate Online", "type": "unit_name"}, {"content": 2, "type": "position"}, {"content": "stub", "type": "origin"}, {"content": 11, "type": "lesson"}, {"content": "B1.2", "type": "level"}], "type": "metadata"}, {"contents": [{"content": "false", "type": "test"}], "type": "achievment_test"}, {"contents": [{"content": " Use expressions about relationships and feelings in a range of social and work contexts. ", "type": "primary"}, {"content": " Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about common technology. ", "type": "secondary_1"}, {"content": " Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about common technology. ", "type": "secondary_2"}, {"content": " Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about common technology. ", "type": "secondary_3"}, {"content": " Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about common technology. ", "type": "secondary_4"}, {"content": " Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about common technology. ", "type": "secondary_5"}, {"content": " Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about common technology. ", "type": "secondary_6"}, {"content": " Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about common technology. ", "type": "secondary_7"}, {"content": " Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about common technology. ", "type": "secondary_8"}], "type": "objectives"}, {"content": "engenn7le11ob02re1img01.jpg", "type": "background_image"}, {"contents": [{"content": " Talking About Someone's Feelings and Reactions", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "You talk about feelings and reactions using adjectives.", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "Adjectives that end in <span class=\"strong\"> -ed </span> are used to describe how a person feels, like <span class=\"italic\">excited</span>, <span class=\"italic\"> amazed </span> or <span class=\"italic\"> interested</span></span>.", "type": "text"}, {"content": " Adjectives that end in <span class=\"strong\">-ing </span> are used to describe things and situations, like   <span class=\"italic\">exciting</span>,   <span class=\"italic\">amazing</span> or   <span class=\"italic\">interesting</span>.  These adjectives describe the   <span class=\"italic\">effect</span> something has on a person.", "type": "text"}, {"content": " I set up my profile last night, and I've already received a few messages. I'm really excited!", "type": "example"}, {"content": "This is exciting!", "type": "example"}, {"content": "Swipe right if you find someone interesting, or swipe left if you're not interested! ", "type": "example"}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"content": " Asking for Help or Advice", "type": "heading"}, {"content": " There are several ways to ask for help in English. You can use polite and casual language to do this.  Let's look at one particular structure for asking for help.", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "You can use the structure:<br/> <span class=\"strong\">Can</span>/ <span class=\"strong\">Could</span>/ <span class=\"strong\">Do</span> +  <span class=\"strong\">you</span> +  <span class=\"strong\">verb</span> +  <span class=\"strong\">me (optional)</span> +  <span class=\"strong\">Question word</span>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "{\"rows\":3,\"columns\":5,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" Can/Could/Do\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" You\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" Verb\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" (me)\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" Question Word\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Could\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" you \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"show\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"me\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" <span class=\\\"strong\\\">how</span> to read the messages?\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Can\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" you \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"tell\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"me\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" <span class=\\\"strong\\\">where</span> to look for them?\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" instruction_table_background intro_table_border\"}", "type": "table"}, {"content": "Can you show me how to read the messages? ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "Can you tell me where to look for them?", "type": "example"}, {"content": "Can you show me how to do that?", "type": "example"}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"content": "to mouse over", "type": "name"}, {"content": " to place your mouse over a text or a link to show more information", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(verb)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: You can mouse over the links on your inbox.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn7le11ob02aud01", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": " These are words you hear in a conversation about social media.", "type": "text"}], "type": "target_word_describer"}, {"contents": [{"content": "to scroll down", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to look for information located below what you see on the computer screen", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(verb)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Just scroll down a little and you should be able to see the pictures.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn7le11ob02aud02", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "to save", "type": "name"}, {"content": " to keep information you need for later use", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(verb)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: You can save the pictures, too.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn7le11ob02aud03", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "to swipe", "type": "name"}, {"content": " to move your finger sideways on a touchscreen to change information", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(verb)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Swipe right if you find someone interesting, or swipe left if you're not interested!", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn7le11ob02aud04", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "to pick up", "type": "name"}, {"content": " to successfully meet someone casually for the first time", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(verb)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: This is much easier than picking someone up at a bar.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn7le11ob02aud05", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "pick-up line", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a conversation opener with the intent to engage someone romantically", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(expression)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: You should still work on your pick-up lines, though!", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn7le11ob02aud07", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "to bookmark", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to save information online for later use", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(verb)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: If you like a profile, you can also bookmark it in your list of favorites.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn7le11ob02aud06", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Think of the qualities you would like to find in an ideal date.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Write 8 to 10 adjectives about them on a piece of paper. They can be physical, emotional, etc. ", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Give the piece of paper to a partner, and take your partner's piece of paper.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Order the list of adjectives, from #1 to #10. #1 is  the most important quality. #10 is  the least important quality.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Share your opinions with your partner.", "type": "text"}], "type": "takeaway_extension"}, {"contents": [{"content": "I write about relationships and friendships.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I talk about feelings and reactions.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I identify qualities in a relationship and express my preferences.", "type": "text"}], "type": "takeaway_assessment"}], "labs": [{"stimuli": [{"template_override": 1, "contents": [{}], "_data": [], "id": 0, "type": "welcome"}, {"template_override": 1, "_data": [], "title": "", "type": "audio", "contents": [{"value": {"images": [{"image": "engenn7le11ob02re2img05.jpg", "time": "0", "id": 0, "text": ""}, {"image": "engenn7le11ob02re2img05.jpg", "time": "100", "id": 1, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>:        Hey Sally! I set up my profile last night, and I've already received a few messages. I'm really excited!<br/><span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>:        This is exciting! <br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>:        The only problem is that I have no idea what to do now. Can you show me how to read them? <br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>:        You can mouse over the links in your inbox. It will open the message on a pop-up page. <br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>:        Do the messages have pictures? Can you tell me where to look for them?"}, {"image": "engenn7le11ob02re2img01.jpg", "time": "28000", "id": 2, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>:        They're at the bottom of the page. Just scroll down a little, and you should be able to see them. You can save the pictures, too.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>:        Oh I see them. This is amazing. <br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>:        I'm glad you are finally amazed by technology! The best thing about Tender is that you can also access it from your phone.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>:        Can you show me how to do that?"}, {"image": "engenn7le11ob02re2img05.jpg", "time": "48000", "id": 3, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>:        Go to the website and log in. Swipe right if you find someone interesting, or swipe left if you're not interested! If you like a profile, you can also bookmark it in your list of favorites.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>:        This is much easier than picking someone up at a bar.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>:        Maybe ... You should still work on your pick-up lines, though!"}], "audiosrc": "engenn7le11ob02re2aud01", "coverimg": "engenn7le11ob02re2img05.jpg"}, "type": "slideshow"}], "id": 1}], "exercises": [{"template_override": 1, "_data": [{"contents": [{"content": " I can talk about technology, friendships and relationships.", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": " I can talk about feelings and reactions.", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": " I can ask for help or advice. ", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": " How important do you think appearances are in a relationship? Why?", "type": "Free Header Item"}, {"content": " What would your ideal date look like?  ", "type": "Free Header Item"}], "type": "instructions"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Welcome", "type": "group_name"}], "type": "group"}, {"c